{"id": "w4-12", "question": "图像文档和文本文档怎样上同一张结果榜？", "relevantDocumentId": "docs/tdd/technical-design-document.md", "relevantDocumentIds": ["docs/tdd/technical-design-document.md"], "evidenceLocation": "docs/tdd/technical-design-document.md#page=null;textUnit=utf16CodeUnit;start=8101;end=8219", "evidenceLocations": ["docs/tdd/technical-design-document.md#page=null;textUnit=utf16CodeUnit;start=8101;end=8219", "docs/tdd/technical-design-document.md#page=null;textUnit=utf16CodeUnit;start=8221;end=8322"], "evidenceText": "图像文档和文本文档上同一张结果榜。图像向量只在 `clipShared` 里召回，文本向量只在 `documentText` 里召回，两路不交叉算余弦。名次用 RRF 合并，`k=60`，图像路权重初值 0.2。图像路没有命中不是失败。\n\n结果携带 `modality`。图像行携带 `imageAsset`（格式、宽、高），界面用它做缩略图和尺寸，不另算一遍分数。`pageNumber == null` 的规则不变，图像行也不显示假页码。", "referenceAnswer": "图像只在 clipShared 召回，文本只在 documentText 召回，两路不交叉算余弦，名次用 RRF 合并。", "answerable": true, "split": "w4", "crossPage": false, "crossChunk": true, "modality": "text", "chunkIndexes": [214, 215], "source": "week4/.index/docs.sqlite chunk boundaries on 2026-10-25"}
